{"page":{"id":"69be033c-dc62-40c4-877a-326246a7c12d","theme":"destiny","slug":"/destiny/vanguard","canonical_url":"https://www.tonolore.com/destiny/vanguard","title":"The Vanguard","meta_title":"The Vanguard (Destiny) — organization, lore & connections | Ton-o-Lore","meta_description":"The Vanguard coordinates Guardian operations from the Tower, historically led by Zavala, Ikora Rey, and Cayde-6. Related pages: Commander Zavala, Ikora Rey,…","content":"<section class=\"intro\">\n    <p class=\"lead\">\n        Leadership of the City&#039;s <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\">Guardians</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    \n    <p>\n        Key threads from this canonical page lead to\n        <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard/zavala\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Commander Zavala</strong></a>, <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard/ikora-rey\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Ikora Rey</strong></a>, <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Guardians</strong></a>, <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard/cayde-6\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>Cayde-6</strong></a>, <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city/tower\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Tower</strong></a> and <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city\" class=\"entity-link\"><strong>The Last City</strong></a>.\n        Each link is another long-tail path through the subject.\n    </p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n\n\n\n<section class=\"connection-narrative\">\n    <h2>How The Vanguard connects</h2>\n    <p>\n        These mapped links are unique to this page — each one is another\n        long-tail route through the subject graph.\n    </p>\n    <ul>\n        \n        <li>\n            <strong>Has Member:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard/zavala\" class=\"entity-link\">Commander Zavala</a>\n            — Zavala is Titan Vanguard.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Has Member:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard/ikora-rey\" class=\"entity-link\">Ikora Rey</a>\n            — Ikora is Warlock Vanguard.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Leads:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\">Guardians</a>\n            — The Vanguard leads the <a href=\"/destiny/light/guardians\" class=\"entity-link\">Guardians</a>.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Has Member:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard/cayde-6\" class=\"entity-link\">Cayde-6</a>\n            — <a href=\"/destiny/vanguard/cayde-6\" class=\"entity-link\">Cayde-6</a> was Hunter Vanguard.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city/tower\" class=\"entity-link\">The Tower</a>\n            — The Vanguard is connected to <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city/tower\" class=\"entity-link\">The Tower</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n        <li>\n            <strong>Connected To:</strong>\n            <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city\" class=\"entity-link\">The Last City</a>\n            — The Vanguard is connected to <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city\" class=\"entity-link\">The Last City</a> through shared lore.\n        </li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"graph-section\">\n    <h2>Mapped connections</h2>\n\n    <p class=\"section-intro\">\n        Every edge is another route through the subject. Expand a group\n        to see how these threads fit together.\n    </p>\n\n    \n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Has Member</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">3</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/destiny/vanguard/zavala\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Has Member\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Commander Zavala</strong>\n           