ink\">\n            Cayde-6\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Cayde-6 was Hunter Vanguard.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">2</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city/tower\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>The Tower</strong>\n                    <span>Guardian hub overlooking the City.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>The Last City</strong>\n                    <span>Humanity&#039;s refuge beneath the Traveler.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/destiny/traveler/the-city/tower\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            The Tower\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>The Vanguard is connected to The Tower through shared lore.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\